tyle=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n<br/>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 14px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rdcv4XS9WJthsDunK3o1icb25R93qTbzP7VFEoo9kicNPRYvbGTsOJCnwjq9P2uW0vc0P6WbnPb2bQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           庄园介绍\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          利巴多的希望庄园位于慧兰的皮塔利托镇，庄园的最高处可达海拔1850米。从3年前开始生产精品级别的咖啡。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          利巴多是咖篮在慧兰直采的小农之一，同属于Chilito家族。Libardo已经是Chilito家族的第三代咖农。他决定改变种植的品种，来试验与传统种植的不同所带来的效益。庄园目前种植有瑰夏及粉红波旁。庄园的鲜果非常的甜美，这里位于当地一处干净的天然泉水旁，处理用水取自天然山泉，目前栎树庄园的第四代咖农Alexandra在帮助其处理品质把控；\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          Libardo对咖啡进行有选择性的采收，具有严格的标准，并且通过浮选去除过度成熟干果，并进行手选鲜果，去除未熟果，之后进行发酵并进行晾晒。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Tu1AvnwIWrCMPj3E2W2BPsxYXqg6LF3KsyuLqaYS2uPMUGqh5icbLaqicDHyXKgWN3aibkkQ73DxFpg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 12px;\">\n          Libardo Chilito\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于本批次处理\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这是我们定制的一个批次，类似于绿宝石和Tamana的定制，也是简化发酵过程：\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            鲜果筛选\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            袋内厌氧3天\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            晒床缓慢干燥晾晒\n            <strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Tu1AvnwIWrCMPj3E2W2BPszMliaOCkABS354FlaXhWhJRia5aa0Du8DqplPic26CjhAph37GbZicrTlA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          文章内容和图片来自广州咖篮\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margi